OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Thieves Gold
Description	One rival keeper, and a lake with more gold on its island than in both your seams together. Mine it before he does. Skirmish, 1 opponent. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in a ruin, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

